---
/**
 * src/pages/en/index.astro
 * ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 * English home page — the first page most visitors see.
 *
 * Structure:
 *   Hero          — full-width section via slot="hero" in BaseLayout
 *   Section 1     — Introduction to Olineri
 *   Section 2     — The Five Paths
 *   CTA Row       — Links to key pages
 *
 * Tamil equivalent: src/pages/ta/index.astro
 * ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
 */

import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Home">

  <!-- ── Hero (full-width, outside <main>) ──────────────────────────────────
       Uses slot="hero" so it sits above the max-w-6xl main wrapper in
       BaseLayout and spans edge to edge on all screen sizes.
  ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
  <Fragment slot="hero">
    <section class="bg-gradient-to-br from-[#78350F] to-[#B45309] py-16 md:py-24 px-6 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#FFD700] mb-5">
        Vallalar Adhiyinam · Olineri Peedam
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white leading-tight mb-6" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">
        Spiritual Path to Inner Transformation
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-white/90 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10">
        Discover the ancient wisdom of the Primordial (Adhi) Maha Yogi — Inquire within yourself for the principles to a fulfilled life, and awaken the radiant light that dwells within you.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center">
        <a href="#introduction" class="bg-[#FFD700] text-[#8B4513] font-bold px-7 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm hover:bg-yellow-300 transition-colors">
          Learn About Olineri
        </a>
        <a href="#five-paths" class="border-2 border-white text-white font-semibold px-7 py-3 rounded-lg text-sm hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors">
          Explore the Five Paths
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </Fragment>

  <!-- ── Page content (inside <main> via default slot) ──────────────────── -->
  <div class="space-y-16 pt-4">

    <!-- ── Section 1: Introduction ──────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="text-left">
      <p id="introduction" class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-900 mb-2">What is Olineri?</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-900 mb-5" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">
        Olineri — An Introduction
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-6">
        In the name of devotion, crowds have surged in temples today. Similarly, in the name of wisdom,
        ashrams are overflowing with people. Yet, human society is losing its humanity and living without
        clarity.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="border-l-4 border-[#FFD700] bg-amber-50 px-6 py-4 rounded-r-lg mb-6">
        <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-amber-900 italic" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">
          Despite accepting and gaining understanding through teachings, books, spiritual masters,
          discourses, and meditation techniques, humanity suffers — unable to practice them and live
          a fulfilling life.
        </p>
      </blockquote>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700">
        <strong>Olineri</strong> is the way of life that prompts an individual to investigate the
        root cause within themselves, transforming a human into a great being and turning them into a
        divine field where the Almighty manifests.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- ── Section 2: Five Paths ────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="text-left">
      <p id="five-paths" class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-900 mb-2">The Five Paths</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-900 mb-4" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">
        Paths to Realise Olineri
      </h2>
      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 mb-8">
        The Primordial (Adhi) Maha Yogi, the Supreme Guru of the ancient Gurukula tradition, sowed
        the secrets of Universal Supreme Truths in five places.
      </p>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5 mb-8">

        <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="bg-[#8B4513] text-white text-xs font-bold w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">1</span>
            <span class="text-xl">🛕</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-900">Temple &amp; Ritual</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            He concealed them within divine forms of temple and in the related ritualistic worship practices.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="bg-[#8B4513] text-white text-xs font-bold w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">2</span>
            <span class="text-xl">📜</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-900">Language</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            He sowed them within language — seeding intellectual explanations in Tamil and vibrational/movement explanations in Sanskrit.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="bg-[#8B4513] text-white text-xs font-bold w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">3</span>
            <span class="text-xl">🌿</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-900">Way of Life</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            He embedded these Supreme Truths within the way of life (culture) that humans ought to lead.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="bg-[#8B4513] text-white text-xs font-bold w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">4</span>
            <span class="text-xl">🧘</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-900">Initiating Guru</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            He reveals these truths by manifesting as the Initiating Guru (Upadesa Guru) in ancient Gurukula classes.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-5">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3">
            <span class="bg-[#8B4513] text-white text-xs font-bold w-7 h-7 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">5</span>
            <span class="text-xl">✨</span>
            <span class="font-bold text-amber-900">Intuition</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            For those who have attained maturity in their inward journey, He continues these teachings in the form of intuition.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-700 italic">
        Vallalar Adhiyinam is the organization dedicated to revealing these rare teachings to humanity,
        which were attained by striving through these five paths.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- ── CTA Row ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
    <section class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 text-center">
      <p class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-amber-900 mb-3">Continue Your Journey</p>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-amber-900 mb-3" style="font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;">
        Ready to explore further?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 mb-7">Dive into teachings, services, books, and more.</p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 justify-center">
        <a href="/en/about"    class="border-2 border-[#8B4513] text-[#8B4513] font-bold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm hover:bg-amber-100 transition-colors">About Vallalar Adhiyinam</a>
        <a href="/en/services" class="bg-[#8B4513] text-white font-bold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm hover:bg-[#B8860B] transition-colors">Our Services</a>
        <a href="/en/books" class="bg-[#8B4513] text-white font-bold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm hover:bg-[#B8860B] transition-colors">Our Books</a>
        <a href="/en/learn/essays" class="bg-[#8B4513] text-white font-bold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm hover:bg-[#B8860B] transition-colors">Essays</a>
        <a href="/en/gallery"  class="border-2 border-[#8B4513] text-[#8B4513] font-bold px-5 py-2.5 rounded-lg text-sm hover:bg-amber-100 transition-colors">Browse the Gallery</a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </div>

</BaseLayout>